  m_text: 'Fortune tools let you peek at or change the deck, but each one costs <b>Spirit</b>. You start with 3 Spirit and gain 1 after every reading that does not break. Spirit carries over between customers and nights.

    Using a tool does not draw a card, so you can use several before you decide.'
